# Build-context allowlist for the INTERNAL PROJECTION service image.
#
# Separate from `gcloudignore` (the served API's context) and
# `gcloudignore-generation` (the offline job's). Neither is modified.
#
# This context is the NARROWEST of the three: the projection service reads no
# workbook and no taxonomy, so unlike the generation image it admits nothing
# from genex-parent at all.
#
# Ignore everything, then re-admit only the two pilot packages.

*

!pilot_backend/
!pilot_backend/**
!pilot_runtime/
!pilot_runtime/**

pilot_backend/tests/**
pilot_runtime/tests/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
